  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio $\\frac{K_p}{K_c}$ for the reaction\n$\\mathrm{CO}(g)+\\frac{1}{2} O_2(g) \\rightleftharpoons C O_2(g)$ is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{R T}}$\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(R T)^{1 / 2}$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{RT}$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$1$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{P}}=\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{C}}(\\mathrm{RT})^{\\Delta \\mathrm{n}_{\\mathrm{g}}}$\nFor the reaction\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{CO}(\\mathrm{g})+\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{O}_2(g) \\leftrightharpoons \\mathrm{CO}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) \\\\\n& \\Delta n_g=1-\\left(1+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{2}\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\therefore K_{\\mathrm{P}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{C}}}{\\sqrt{\\mathrm{RT}}} ; \\quad \\frac{\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{P}}}{\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{C}}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{R T}}$"
  }
}